# Hermes Cortex brain source — .gitignore
#
# MEMORY.md and USER.md are private to each Hermes instance.
# They contain per-machine topology, agent identity, and user preferences.
# Never share them across machines or commit to shared repos.
MEMORY.md
USER.md

# Never commit secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.cert

# OS junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
